    "AMP03 pins: SIG on -IN (pin 2), GND on +IN (pin 3), REF (pin 1) to GND, SENSE tied to OUT, so each AMP03 inverts (Vout = GND_x - SIG_x) and U5 inverts again. Coarse path: R1 4.7k + R6 47k = 51.7k, C9 30 nF; corner = 1/(2π·(4.7k||47k)·30n) ≈ 1.24 kHz. Fine path equivalent resistance 5.06 MΩ, AC/DC (50k) 25.1 MΩ.",
    "Update the notes on the schematic with the real numbers (setpoint-to-shunt-voltage gain per channel) and the per-axis R5 value so that the Supertime scaling can be set correctly.",
