    "/From Shunt Ground: J3.2[power_out], U5.3[+|input]; GND net: U2.1, U3.1, U4.1, U6.1 (REF pins), J2.2. ERC [pin_to_pin] error is only the J3 symbol being typed 'power output' on a signal pin.",
