    "/SIG_Coarse: J1.2, J4.2, U2.2; /Vin_RV: J4.1, U1.6; J4.3 on GND; W1 (0Ω) ties GND_Coarse to GND.",
    "Leave J1 unplugged when the pot is used (or add a jumper/switch), specify a pot value (about 5k to 10k like the 2019 design) and add 100 to 200Ω in series with J4.1.",
