    "unconnected-(U5-VOS-Pad1), unconnected-(U5-VOS-Pad8), unconnected-(U1-TRIM-Pad5); +15V: C2,C3,C5,C7,C11,C13 (all 0.1µF); -15V: C4,C6,C8,C12,C14.",
